With this secession, she called on the youth to stop believing in the incitement of the opposition and join the Royal Government to develop the country and resume legitimate actions.
In a video obtained by Fresh News, Srey Nich confirmed that she has now decided to join the 100 Nights Youth because of her past activities with Khmer Thavorak, which is illegal and often accuses the Royal Government of The tendency to disrespect democracy, which makes the country underdeveloped and without respect for human rights.
