This request was made on the occasion of Mr. Anatoly Borovic and his colleagues visiting the Samdech Mey Library of the Documentation Center of Cambodia on the morning of April 19, 2023, with a welcome from Mr. Chhang Youk, Director of the Documentation Center of Cambodia.
