General Neth Savoeun orders the temporary suspension of the Deputy Inspector of Ba Phnom District and sends the case to court after a weapon exploded, injuring a citizen in a cockfighting operation.
(Prey Veng): General Dr. Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner General, has ordered the suspension of a deputy inspector of Prey Veng province's Ba Phnom district and sent the case to the provincial court for further proceedings after a firearm exploded, injuring a villager. Injuries in the operation to crack down on gambling offenses.
On the afternoon of April 18, 2023, Prey Veng Provincial Police Commissioner Major General Chhoeun Bunchorn told Fresh News: "And send the case to court in the case of an explosion that caused injuries in the operation to crack down on cockfighting."
Please be reminded that the Police Inspectorate of Ba Phnom District, Prey Veng Province cracked down on illegal gambling sites (cockfighting) at Krous village, Chheu Karch commune, but during the crackdown, the gamblers clashed with the police, causing gunfire. One injured.
During the patrol in the above area, some villagers reported that they were stealing gambling (cockfighting) at Krous village, Chheu Karch commune, Ba Phnom district, Prey Veng province.
