(Kampong Cham): The Governor of Kampong Cham Province, Mr. Un Chanda, and his team on the morning of April 18, 2023, received congratulations from the people in Koh Sotin district, especially the people in Peam Prathnos commune, where he decided to build a concrete bridge across the small river. In front of Wat Peam Prathnos, Peam Prathnos Commune, Koh Sotin District, to facilitate the movement of people.
The governor of Kampong Cham province has ordered the excavation authorities to leave the site where the monks and villagers have dumped soil to make the road from one side to the other side of the small river back to its original condition.
He also ordered the authorities to build a 90- to 100-meter-long concrete bridge to facilitate the movement of people there and to end the water dispute as well as facilitate the flow of water. Normally, the people in the lower part, especially in Pearang and Sithor Kandal districts, Prey Veng province, have enough water from the Mekong River through the small river in Koh Sotin district.
