With the organization of this Battambang Sankranti on the night of April 16, 2023, which is the last day of the Battambang Sankranti 2023 event, Mr. Sok Lou, Governor of Battambang Province, and Mr. Sar Ratha, President of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, Battambang Province, and Mrs. Leading the Provincial CPPCC and all the organizing team had a talk and congratulated the people as well as all national and international guests who came to visit.
Mr. Sok Lou said that the fact that we can organize this Battambang Sankranti event also depends on peace, so we all express our deep gratitude to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, along with other top leaders. Others have worked hard to bring peace to the people, so we can happily organize this event.
He continued that Battambang province under the direct guidance of Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Interior and Chairman of the Royal Government Working Group visited Battambang province has made Battambang province grow day by day. All sectors make people's lives more prosperous.
On behalf of the Battambang Provincial Administration, I would like to wish the New Year Deity Chhnang Thao Panchaksak, Kimira Devi, to take care of the Governor, to bless all kinds of blessings, and to have the four blessings of the Buddha: age, class, happiness, and strength. In all Battambang provinces.
In this Battambang Sankranti event, all the people and tourists expressed their happiness that the Royal Government of Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Techo Prime Minister and the provincial administration has allowed to organize a happy gathering on the occasion of the traditional New Year. Khmer nation under the shadow of cold peace.
