Fourth, continue to postpone the implementation of capital gains tax only for the real estate sector until the end of 2024.
Fifth, continue the stamp duty exemption on the transfer of ownership or possession of all types of housing in the form of a Borey with a value of less than or equal to 70,000 US dollars until the end of 2024.
