This program of Kraing Thnong Village Sanctuary was organized by Mr. Chhit Bora Vuth, Deputy Chairman of Kraing Thnong Commune Assistance Team and in charge of Kraing Thnong Village and members of the Bar Association to assist Kraing Thnong Village together with members of the Government Bar Association to assist Kraing Thnong Commune. The whole village of Kraing Thnong commune.
Speaking at the opening ceremony of the village, Mr. Chea Vandeth said that the people have the opportunity to gather, dance and play traditional games now because the country is peaceful and developed as the country is developed. It is because of the leadership of the Cambodian People's Party, with Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, as the sole guide.
